+On ppc64le, vcpkg also needs `VCPKG_FORCE_SYSTEM_BINARIES=1` set in the environment.
 
 On macOS, use the matching `macos-arm64-clang-rwdi` or `macos-x64-clang-rwdi` preset.
 
